## Database Management

### Development Database

```bash
# Start database
make db-up

# Stop database
make db-down

# View logs
make db-logs

# Connect with psql
make db-psql

# Run migrations
make db-migrate
```

### Test Database

```bash
# Start test database (separate container)
make test-db-up

# Stop test database
make test-db-down

# Migrate test database
make test-db-migrate
```

### Database Connection String Format

The system uses SQLAlchemy connection strings:
```
postgresql+psycopg://{DB_USER}:{DB_PASSWORD}@{DB_HOST}:{DB_PORT}/{DB_DATABASE}
```

Example:
```
postgresql+psycopg://polytrader:password@localhost:5432/polytrader
```

